    "3f91bc16-16e6-434a-8427-9cd5fc389355": {
      "type": "gm-image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16844372279511__3f91bc16-16e6-434a-8427-9cd5fc389355-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Home delivery",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "template--16844372279511__3f91bc16-16e6-434a-8427-9cd5fc389355-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Of course it's often more convenient to have your order delivered to your door so we offer that too.&nbsp;</p><p>We do our own deliveries in the Brisbane area from Wednesday to Saturday and use refrigerated couriers to deliver to the Sunshine Coast, the Gold Coast, Tweed Heads and Northern NSW.<br/><br/>Home delivery is a flat rate of $12.50. For Brisbane and northern Gold Coast customers, we offer free delivery on orders over $200. A temporary fuel levy also applies: $2 for local deliveries and $4 for refrigerated courier orders.<br/><br/>Frozen and cold items will be packed in Styrofoam or chilltainers with ice packs. Please arrange to take them inside quickly.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
