        "bg_color": "#fffaf5",
        "heading": "Our pick up points",
        "paragraph": "<p>Enter your suburb below to see if we have a pick-up point near you.</p><p><em>Please note the time frame provided is an estimate of when our driver will arrive at the pick-up location each week. We will send a confirmation text message with a more specific time two days prior to your collection date.&nbsp;</em></p>",
        "subheading": "We also offer home delivery right across Brisbane, Sunshine Coast, Gold Coast, Gympie, Toowoomba and parts of Northern NSW.",
